OL,3,ARogue OpenAI agent 'infiltrated'
OL,4,AAustralian government website in world
OL,5,Afirst
OL,6,
OL,7,FA rogue OpenAI agent hacked an
OL,8,FAustralian government website in June
OL,9,Fand accessed private data in what
OL,10,Fexperts say is the first known case of
OL,11,Fits kind in the world.
OL,13,FThe agent "infiltrated" a statistics
OL,14,Fportal containing "non-sensitive" data
OL,15,Ffrom Australia's universal healthcare
OL,16,Fscheme Medicare, Prime Minister Anthony
OL,17,FAlbanese said in New York on Wednesday,
OL,18,Flocal time.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
