OL,3,APoland says fire at Starlink station is
OL,4,Asabotage as Denmark warns of rising
OL,5,ARussian threat
OL,6,
OL,7,FA fire at a Starlink satellite station
OL,8,Fin central Poland was a deliberate "act
OL,9,Fof sabotage", a government minister has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FPolish Deputy Prime Minister Krzysztof
OL,13,FGawkowski said the fire in the Masovian
OL,14,FVoivodeship province was "deliberately
OL,15,Fdesigned to disable the station...
OL,16,Fdisrupting internet access for various
OL,17,Finstitutions, including the Ukrainian
OL,18,Farmy".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
